### Home Sweet Home agent — REST client requests
###
### Generate a token first:
###   pnpm token:generate -- --caller-id you --permissions read,write,destructive
### Then set the variables below.

@host = http://127.0.0.1:3400
@token = paste-your-bearer-token-here

### Health: overall status, per-module status, LLM readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ask a question (grounded in module data)
POST {{host}}/conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "When is the next bus at my stop?"
}

### Ask a follow-up in the same conversation
POST {{host}}/conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What about the weather?",
  "conversationId": "paste-conversation-id-here"
}

### Approve a pending destructive action
POST {{host}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "paste-conversation-id-here",
  "confirmationToken": "paste-confirmation-token-here",
  "decision": "approve"
}

### Reject a pending destructive action
POST {{host}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "paste-conversation-id-here",
  "confirmationToken": "paste-confirmation-token-here",
  "decision": "reject"
}

### Accept a notification event (contract only; not scheduled)
POST {{host}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "bus.departure",
  "severity": "info",
  "payload": { "stopId": "123", "line": "758", "minutes": 3 },
  "target": "home-assistant"
}
